    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Terror Diversion is a text-based adventure game filled with numerous random events. You play as a girl haunted by spirits, who, after taking a leave from school, arrives in a strange town. Here, she must investigate a series of mysterious incidents while making sure she doesn't collapse from exhaustion or lose her sanity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190430/extras/bf85df2a32e2ea0bfeb55141e97d0b91.avif?t=1736515854\" width=600 height=210 /></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No combat, the developer has thoughtfully removed this part for you (actually, out of laziness).<br></li><li>A dice-based check system involving four attributes: Strength, Dexterity, Charisma, and Perception.<br></li><li>Multiple playable characters, each with their own backstories and stats.<br></li><li>Rich scripts and short stories, each with different flavors and themes.<br></li><li>Tons of random events; if you fail an investigation, blame the &quot;dealer&quot; and try again.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Terror Diversion is a text-based adventure game filled with numerous random events. You play as a girl haunted by spirits, who, after taking a leave from school, arrives in a strange town. Here, she must investigate a series of mysterious incidents while making sure she doesn't collapse from exhaustion or lose her sanity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190430/extras/bf85df2a32e2ea0bfeb55141e97d0b91.avif?t=1736515854\" width=600 height=210 /></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No combat, the developer has thoughtfully removed this part for you (actually, out of laziness).<br></li><li>A dice-based check system involving four attributes: Strength, Dexterity, Charisma, and Perception.<br></li><li>Multiple playable characters, each with their own backstories and stats.<br></li><li>Rich scripts and short stories, each with different flavors and themes.<br></li><li>Tons of random events; if you fail an investigation, blame the &quot;dealer&quot; and try again.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a text-based horror game in which you investigate mysterious urban legends. Along the way, the player takes on the role of a character who gets \u201clost\u201d and encounters a series of random events.",
